1
00:00:00,562 --> 00:00:04,652
(Sheldon:)Anyway, you're aware that Leonard has
entered into a new romantic relationship...

2
00:00:04,816 --> 00:00:07,606
(Sheldon:)...which includes a sexual component.

3
00:00:09,905 --> 00:00:13,245
- Okay, feeling the awkward now.
- Wait.

4
00:00:13,909 --> 00:00:15,489
(Sheldon:)Her name is Dr. Stephanie Barnett.

5
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:19,000
And she's a highly distinguished
surgical resident at Fremont Memorial.

6
00:00:19,164 --> 00:00:20,334
- Yeah, Leonard told me.
- Good.

7
00:00:20,499 --> 00:00:25,339
(Sheldon:)What he may have left out
is how important this relationship is to me.

8
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:27,920
- To you?
- Yes.

9
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:31,010
(Sheldon:)See, of the handful of women
Leonard's been involved with...

10
00:00:31,176 --> 00:00:34,176
(Sheldon:)...she's the only one
I have ever found tolerable.

11
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:40,520
(Penny:)Well, what about me?

12
00:00:41,311 --> 00:00:43,561
(Sheldon:)The statement stands for itself.

13
00:00:45,816 --> 00:00:47,146
(Penny:)Well, aren't you sweet?

14
00:00:47,317 --> 00:00:49,657
(Sheldon:)Anyway, should you have
any interaction with her...

15
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:54,200
(Sheldon:)...it would be most helpful
that she not see you as a sexual rival.

16
00:00:55,534 --> 00:00:57,784
PENNY:
Yeah, I think she's pretty safe.

17
00:00:57,953 --> 00:01:01,023
(Sheldon:)You say that now,
but consider the following scenario.

